## Database Tables

### job_evidence (one row per task per job)
id, job_id, job_status, top_parent_flow, task_name, task_flow,
task_status, issued_by_flow, with_items (nullable), 
flow_payloads (JSON nullable), job_updated_at (nullable datetime),
created_at (datetime, default now)
Unique constraint: (job_id, task_name)

### analysis_checkpoint
id, checkpoint_key (unique string e.g. "global"),
last_job_updated_at (datetime), updated_at (datetime, default now)

## API Endpoints (Demo Milestone)

GET  /health              — verify DB connection
POST /jobs/analyze        — fetch all jobs from Vanish API (pre-2026 only),
                            extract task evidence, insert into job_evidence,
                            update checkpoint. Returns summary.
GET  /jobs                — list all job_evidence rows from DB
GET  /jobs/{job_id}       — single job's tasks from DB

## CLI Output Shape (actual JSON per record)
{
  "job_id": "556bf16f-...",
  "job_status": "SUCCESS",
  "top_parent_flow": "create_access_skeleton_blueprint:1.2",
  "task_name": "create_required_access_components",
  "task_flow": "{{ item.flow_name }}:{{ item.flow_version }}",
  "task_status": "SUCCESS",
  "issued_by_flow": "create_access_skeleton_blueprint:1.2",
  "with_items": "{{ vars.create_skeleton_flows | find_by_label(...) }}",
  "flow_payloads": {"application": "NETPAY", "region": "APAC"}
}

## Domain Knowledge
- job = single execution of a flow
- task can call another flow = subflow
- issued_by_flow = immediate parent, NOT root flow
- top_parent_flow = root flow
- task_name depth = task_name.count("__") + 1
- with_items = loop, creates copies suffixed _0, _1, _2
- status SKIPPED = flow never executed
- Only process jobs from 2025 and earlier (old Vanish implementation)

